{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"代数叠"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"代数叠"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>代数叠又叫 Artin 叠, 是仿射概形的范畴上具有 (平坦) 坐标卡以及适当的可表性的"},{"Local":{"url":"叠","text":"叠"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}